      "hints": [
        "Because the observed frequency is below 400 Hz, decide first whether the car approaches or recedes."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "A lower observed frequency means the source is moving away, so use f_o=f_s v_sound/(v_sound+v_car).",
        "Substitute 360=400×340/(340+v).",
        "Thus 340+v=(400×340)/360=377.78, giving v=37.78 m s⁻¹.",
        "The car travels away from the observer at about 38 m s⁻¹."
      ],
